  "blocks": {
    "\"Depends on the work — a focused refactor stays sharp longer than open-ended research. Once the session bloats, hand off or compact, don't push through.\"": "“取决于工作类型——目标明确的重构，比开放式研究更能长时间保持清晰。会话一旦膨胀，就进行交接或压缩，不要硬撑。”",
    "\"How long can one session run before it falls apart?\"": "“一次会话可以持续多久才会开始崩坏？”",
    "One bounded run of interaction with an agent. Starts empty, accumulates messages, tool results, and files read, and ends when cleared, closed, or compacted into a fresh session. The session is what fills the context window: if the context window is the box, the session is the stuff slowly filling it up. Work too large for a single context window must be split across sessions.": "会话是与<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/agent\">智能体</a>进行的一次有边界交互。它从空白开始，逐渐累积消息、<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/tool-result\">工具结果</a>和读取过的文件，最后因<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/clearing\">清空</a>、关闭，或<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/compaction\">压缩</a>到新会话而结束。会话中的内容会填满<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/context-window\">上下文窗口</a>：如果窗口是一个盒子，会话就是慢慢装进盒子的东西。单个上下文窗口无法容纳的大型工作，必须拆分到多个会话。",
    "That memory ends with the session. A new session starts from nothing: the agent that knew your codebase well at the end of yesterday's session knows none of it this morning. What survives is the filesystem — files written during one session can be read by the next, which is what handoffs, memory systems, and AGENTS.md rely on.": "这份记忆会随会话结束而终止。新会话从零开始：昨天会话结束时对代码库十分熟悉的智能体，今天早上对它一无所知。能够保留下来的是<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/filesystem\">文件系统</a>——一次会话写入的文件可以由下一次会话读取，<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/handoff\">交接</a>、<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/memory-system\">记忆系统</a>和 <a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/agents-md\">AGENTS.md</a> 都依赖这一点。",
    "The session's message history is the agent's working memory. The model is stateless, so everything it appears to remember — what you asked for, what the tests said, what it decided three turns ago — is in the message history, re-sent with every model provider request. Whatever isn't in the session doesn't exist for the agent.": "会话消息历史就是智能体的工作记忆。<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/model\">模型</a>是<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/stateless\">无状态</a>的，因此它表现得像是“记住”的一切——你的要求、测试输出、三个轮次前作出的决定——都存在于消息历史中，并随每次<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/model-provider-request\">模型提供商请求</a>重新发送。不在会话中的内容，对智能体而言就不存在。",
    "Usage:": "<em>用法：</em>",
    "You choose where a session ends. Everything in a session influences every later turn, so unrelated tasks done in one session leave residue that colours the next answer. One task per session keeps the context relevant; finishing a task is a natural point to clear.": "会话何时结束由你决定。会话中的所有内容都会影响后续每个<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/turn\">轮次</a>，因此在同一次会话里处理无关任务，会留下影响下一次回答的残留。每个会话只处理一项任务，可以保持上下文相关；完成任务就是自然的清空节点。"
  },
